          "Title": "dash: dash: Super-polynomial backtracking in pmatch when libc fnmatch is disabled",
          "Description": "A flaw was found in dash. When built without libc fnmatch, the internal pmatch() matcher implements * by unbounded recursion over candidate positions. A local user who can plant filenames, or otherwise feed that matcher, can make a short multi-star pattern such as *.*.*.*.*.tar.gz consume excessive CPU.",
